{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011Cf6JjULrB5LpsYAe2KMXn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and follows the existing codebase patterns. The new endpoint is already registered through the existing `createTagRouter` setup in `app.ts`.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n1. **src/tags/tag.repository.ts** - Added `TagCount` interface and `getPopular()` method that queries the database for the 10 most-used tags with their article counts, ordered by count descending\n\n2. **src/tags/tag.service.ts** - Added `getPopular()` method to expose the repository functionality through the service layer\n\n3. **src/tags/tag.routes.ts** - Added `GET /tags/popular` route handler that returns the JSON response in the exact format specified: `{ \"tags\": [{ \"name\": \"<tag>\", \"count\": <number> }] }`\n\nThe endpoint is now reachable at `GET /api/tags/popular` and returns the ten most-used tags across all articles, most-used first, with each tag showing its name and article count."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":913,"cache_read_input_tokens":36815,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":913},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab58103d-5fac-4eff-b17d-2503b29a8bf8","uuid":"bb8cdcf3-344b-42bb-9280-ee966eb15f34","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:11:07.538Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6JjU11DfPaNaVczuCdq"}
